    "articleId": "b9fc329e1ac891701ae1",
    "status": "ready",
    "html": "\n<p id=\"article-anchor-1\"><span id=\"article-anchor-2\"><span><span>当 AI 已经能替我们写代码，为什么团队整体的交付速度没有想象中那么快？ 答案不在工具里，而在工具之外——在流程、在分工、在组织结构里。</span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-3\"><span id=\"article-anchor-4\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"section-一-现状-ai-加速了局部-却照出了组织的摩擦\"><span id=\"article-anchor-6\">一、现状：AI 加速了局部，却照出了组织的摩擦</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-一-现状-ai-加速了局部-却照出了组织的摩擦\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：一、现状：AI 加速了局部，却照出了组织的摩擦\">#</a></h2>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-7\"><span id=\"article-anchor-8\">近一年，整个产研团队做了大量 AI 编码的实践与推广，AI 代码生成率持续提高，越来越多的需求进入了深度人机协作阶段。但当实践规模扩大之后，一个反直觉的现象浮出水面：</span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-9\"><span id=\"article-anchor-10\"><span><span>参与同一个需求的开发人员越多，AI 带来的提效幅度却不明显。</span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-11\"><span id=\"article-anchor-12\">单看局部，一些开发和测试环节确实已经被 AI 显著加速；可从整体数据看，\"AI 深度参与的需求占比\"并没有像预期那样与\"人均需求交付数\"同步增长。继续下钻，我们发现真正抵消 AI 收益的，已经不再是工具能力，而是<span id=\"article-anchor-13\"><span><span>工具之外的环节<span id=\"article-anchor-14\">：</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-15\"><span>•需求对齐、跨角色协作、任务交接和等待，仍然按照 AI 出现之前的传统方式在运行；</span></div>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-16\"><span>•不同开发者使用 AI 的能力严重分化，同一个工具在不同人手里产出天差地别；</span></div>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-17\"><span>•业务、产品、研发相互分离，让个别标杆团队摸索出来的经验，很难规模化复制到其他团队。</span></div>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-18\"><span id=\"article-anchor-19\">一句话概括：<span id=\"article-anchor-20\"><span><span>AI 加速了局部工作，也让原有组织中的摩擦，更加集中地暴露了出来。<span id=\"article-anchor-21\"> 工具越快，流程与组织的\"堵点\"就越刺眼。这不是 AI 没用，而是我们只把 AI 用在了\"写代码\"这一个点上，却没有动\"怎么协作、谁做什么、团队怎么组织\"这些更根本的地方。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-22\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-23\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-19-59ZxB24c7HwJVOmAiT.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-24\">\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"section-二-根因剖析-卡点在-人-流程-组织-三层\"><span id=\"article-anchor-26\">二、根因剖析：卡点在\"人、流程、组织\"三层</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-二-根因剖析-卡点在-人-流程-组织-三层\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：二、根因剖析：卡点在&quot;人、流程、组织&quot;三层\">#</a></h2>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-27\"><span id=\"article-anchor-28\">顺着现象往下挖，提效被抵消的根因，可以清晰地归到三层：</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-①-人-开发人员的-ai-能力两极分化\"><span id=\"article-anchor-30\">① 人：开发人员的 AI 能力两极分化</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-①-人-开发人员的-ai-能力两极分化\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：① 人：开发人员的 AI 能力两极分化\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-31\"><span id=\"article-anchor-32\">会用的人，让 AI 帮自己完成一整段设计与实现；不会用的人，AI 只是一个更花哨的搜索框。当交付依赖\"某几个高手\"时，AI 的收益就被牢牢锁死在个人能力上——<span id=\"article-anchor-33\"><span><span>能力没有沉淀为团队资产，而是散落在个人经验里。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-②-流程与分工-参与的人越多-提效幅度越小\"><span id=\"article-anchor-35\">② 流程与分工：参与的人越多，提效幅度越小</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-②-流程与分工-参与的人越多-提效幅度越小\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：② 流程与分工：参与的人越多，提效幅度越小\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-36\"><span id=\"article-anchor-37\">这是最违反直觉、也最关键的一条。AI 把\"写代码\"这段压缩得很短，于是<span id=\"article-anchor-38\"><span><span>需求对齐、跨角色确认、任务交接、互相等待<span id=\"article-anchor-39\">这些\"人与人之间\"的成本，在总耗时里的占比被急剧放大。参与的人越多，需要对齐和交接的次数就越多，被放大的摩擦也就越多。<span id=\"article-anchor-40\"><span><span>AI 提速的是\"做\"，但拖住整体的是\"等\"和\"传\"。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-③-业务特点与组织结构-标杆团队效率高-但规模复制难\"><span id=\"article-anchor-42\">③ 业务特点与组织结构：标杆团队效率高，但规模复制难</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-③-业务特点与组织结构-标杆团队效率高-但规模复制难\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：③ 业务特点与组织结构：标杆团队效率高，但规模复制难\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-43\"><span id=\"article-anchor-44\">个别团队靠着对业务的深刻理解和一套自己的协作默契，把 AI 用出了很高的效率。但这套效率高度依赖<span id=\"article-anchor-45\"><span><span>特定的人、特定的上下文、特定的默契<span id=\"article-anchor-46\">，一旦换一个团队、换一个业务域，就水土不服。烟囱式的组织切分，让经验沉淀在\"孤岛\"里，难以标准化、难以克隆。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-47\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-48\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-19-5924DMyoUsujQCGGH6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-49\">\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"section-两条路径的分野-研发视角-vs-组织视角\"><span id=\"article-anchor-51\">两条路径的分野：研发视角 vs 组织视角</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-两条路径的分野-研发视角-vs-组织视角\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：两条路径的分野：研发视角 vs 组织视角\">#</a></h2>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-52\"><span id=\"article-anchor-53\">这三层根因，指向一个更深的判断——<span id=\"article-anchor-54\"><span><span>我们究竟站在哪个视角上用 AI？</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-55\"><span id=\"article-anchor-56\"><span><code>AI × 工具 → AI × 研发人员 → 推动研发组织变革。</code><span id=\"article-anchor-57\"> 它从增强工具（AI Coding）起步，再增强研发人员（人均提效），最后试图从研发一侧去推动组织变革。这条路走得对，但<span id=\"article-anchor-58\"><span><span>走到\"推动研发组织变革\"这一步就到了边界<span id=\"article-anchor-59\">——因为研发视角只能改研发自己那一段，而现状里真正的堵点（需求对齐、跨角色协作、烟囱式组织）恰恰<span id=\"article-anchor-60\"><span><span>横跨业务、产品、研发的边界<span id=\"article-anchor-61\">。研发视角够不着这些边界之外的摩擦，自然也就推不动。<span id=\"article-anchor-62\"><span><span>能力再强的研发，也无法单方面重构一个需要业产技共同参与的交付流程。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-63\"><span id=\"article-anchor-64\"><span><code>AI × 工具 → AI × 员工 → AI × 团队 → AI × 组织。</code><span id=\"article-anchor-65\"> 它不把 AI 局限在\"研发\"这一个工种上，而是：先用 AI 增强工具，再让 AI 增强<span id=\"article-anchor-66\"><span><span>每一类员工<span id=\"article-anchor-67\">（不只是研发，也包括产品、测试、调度等所有岗位），进而把这些被 AI 增强的岗位重组为<span id=\"article-anchor-68\"><span><span>人机协同的团队<span id=\"article-anchor-69\">，最终用 AI 去重构<span id=\"article-anchor-70\"><span><span>整个交付组织<span id=\"article-anchor-71\">的运转方式。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-72\"><span id=\"article-anchor-73\">两条路径在前半段重合，却在后半段分道扬镳：研发视角止步于\"研发内部的优化\"，组织视角则跨过了那道边界，走向\"整个组织的重新设计\"。<span id=\"article-anchor-74\"><span><span>这，就是从\"AI 写代码\"到\"AI 组织转型\"的分水岭。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-75\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-76\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-00a24LYIz0W08n0Acs.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-77\">\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"section-三-打法-用-ai-重新设计交付流程-角色分工与组织结构\"><span id=\"article-anchor-79\">三、打法：用 AI 重新设计交付流程、角色分工与组织结构</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-三-打法-用-ai-重新设计交付流程-角色分工与组织结构\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：三、打法：用 AI 重新设计交付流程、角色分工与组织结构\">#</a></h2>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-80\"><span id=\"article-anchor-81\">既然根因在\"人、流程、组织\"三层，卡点又在于研发视角够不到的边界，那么打法就必然是站在<span id=\"article-anchor-82\"><span><span>组织视角<span id=\"article-anchor-83\">上，用 AI 把交付这件事<span id=\"article-anchor-84\"><span><span>重新设计一遍<span id=\"article-anchor-85\">——不是给旧流程加个 AI 插件，而是以 AI 为一等公民，重构流程、角色与结构。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-86\"><span id=\"article-anchor-87\">国际技术部 Multi AI Native（Multica）平台，正是这套打法的落地载体。它的口号是\"<span id=\"article-anchor-88\"><span><span>你的下一批员工，不是人类<span id=\"article-anchor-89\">\"——把 Claude Code、Codex 等主流 AI 编码智能体，转化为真正的<span id=\"article-anchor-90\"><span><span>团队成员<span id=\"article-anchor-91\">：可以像给同事分派任务一样，把需求分配给 Agent，Agent 会自主接手、编写代码、更新状态、报告阻塞。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-92\"><span id=\"article-anchor-93\">下面把三层根因与三步打法<span id=\"article-anchor-94\"><span><span>一一对应<span id=\"article-anchor-95\">起来。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-打法一-重新设计-角色分工-把个人能力沉淀为岗位角色与技能库-破解根因①\"><span id=\"article-anchor-97\">打法一：重新设计\"角色分工\"——把个人能力沉淀为岗位角色与技能库（破解根因①）</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-打法一-重新设计-角色分工-把个人能力沉淀为岗位角色与技能库-破解根因①\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：打法一：重新设计&quot;角色分工&quot;——把个人能力沉淀为岗位角色与技能库（破解根因①）\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-98\"><span id=\"article-anchor-99\">针对\"能力两极分化\"，答案不是培训每一个人成为高手，而是<span id=\"article-anchor-100\"><span><span>把能力从\"个人经验\"变成\"组织资产\"<span id=\"article-anchor-101\">。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-102\"><span id=\"article-anchor-103\"><span><span>Agent 是数字化的岗位角色，对标企业真实研发岗位。<span id=\"article-anchor-104\"> 平台内置调度、产品、研发、测试等专业 Agent，每个 Agent 拥有固定职能边界、标准化工作指令与专属工作场景。测试用例、PRD、消息、行云部署、DB 操作等具体能力，被沉淀为<span id=\"article-anchor-105\"><span><span>可复用的 Skill 技能库、规约中心<span id=\"article-anchor-106\">，在整个工作区内被各 Agent 反复调用。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-107\"><span id=\"article-anchor-108\">如此，交付不再依赖\"某几个会用 AI 的高手\"，而是依赖一套<span id=\"article-anchor-109\"><span><span>标准化、可复用、持续沉淀<span id=\"article-anchor-110\">的岗位角色与技能资产。能力差异不再是瓶颈。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-打法二-重新设计-交付流程-以-issue-为唯一事实源-用调度替代人肉交接-破解根因②\"><span id=\"article-anchor-112\">打法二：重新设计\"交付流程\"——以 Issue 为唯一事实源，用调度替代人肉交接（破解根因②）</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-打法二-重新设计-交付流程-以-issue-为唯一事实源-用调度替代人肉交接-破解根因②\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：打法二：重新设计&quot;交付流程&quot;——以 Issue 为唯一事实源，用调度替代人肉交接（破解根因②）\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-113\"><span id=\"article-anchor-114\">针对\"人越多、提效越小\"，答案是<span id=\"article-anchor-115\"><span><span>砍掉需求对齐与任务交接中的人肉损耗<span id=\"article-anchor-116\">。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-117\"><span>•Issue 是统一的最小交付载体，也是唯一事实源。 需求描述、验收标准、字段、评论、版本快照全部落在同一份 Issue 上，所有 Agent 读写同一份数据。一个 Issue 下的所有文档、改动、上下文，涉及的每个 Agent 都能共享，不会\"失忆\"，不需要反复重新输入——需求记忆共享，从根本上消灭了\"反复对齐\"这项成本。</span></div>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-118\"><span>•Leader 只负责调度，是整个项目的大脑。 调度 Leader 拆分任务、分派给各 Agent、汇总验收，Agent 之间可并行推进子任务，再由 Leader 统一收口。人与人之间的\"等待与传递\"，被 Agent 集群的并行协作与自动流转取代。</span></div>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-119\"><span id=\"article-anchor-120\">流程的重构，让\"参与方越多摩擦越大\"的诅咒被打破：协作成本不再随人数线性膨胀，而是收敛到一份结构化的 Issue 与一套自动调度里。</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-打法三-重新设计-组织结构-用可复制的自治小队替代烟囱式团队-破解根因③\"><span id=\"article-anchor-122\">打法三：重新设计\"组织结构\"——用可复制的自治小队替代烟囱式团队（破解根因③）</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-打法三-重新设计-组织结构-用可复制的自治小队替代烟囱式团队-破解根因③\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：打法三：重新设计&quot;组织结构&quot;——用可复制的自治小队替代烟囱式团队（破解根因③）\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-123\"><span id=\"article-anchor-124\">针对\"标杆难复制\"，答案是<span id=\"article-anchor-125\"><span><span>把\"团队\"本身做成一个可标准化、可克隆的单元<span id=\"article-anchor-126\">。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-127\"><span id=\"article-anchor-128\"><span><span>Squad 小队是 AI 研发交付的最小自治业务单元。<span id=\"article-anchor-129\"> 它以垂直业务域为边界，内置完整的调度、产品、研发、测试 Agent 集群，可独立完成从需求承接、任务拆解、迭代开发、质量校验到交付闭环的全流程。小队权责独立、上下文独立、迭代节奏独立，队内自主协同，跨队统一通过调度中枢对接——<span id=\"article-anchor-130\"><span><span>这是一种为人机协同重新设计的组织形态。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-131\"><span id=\"article-anchor-132\"><span><span>精品小队与模板可一键复制。<span id=\"article-anchor-133\"> 创建小队时可浏览、克隆其他工作区已验证的优秀小队，复制时自动带走全部 Agent 的 Skills 与指令。标杆团队的协作范式，第一次变成了<span id=\"article-anchor-134\"><span><span>可以被整建制克隆<span id=\"article-anchor-135\">的组织资产，而不再是困在某个团队里的默契。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-136\"><span id=\"article-anchor-137\">组织结构的重构，让\"标杆经验\"从不可复制的孤岛，变成了可规模化铺开的模板。</span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-138\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-139\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-00Ratb8PEu888Sxw8.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-140\">\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"section-打法闭环-规约栅栏-持续改进飞轮\"><span id=\"article-anchor-142\"><span><span>打法闭环：规约栅栏 + 持续改进飞轮</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-打法闭环-规约栅栏-持续改进飞轮\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：打法闭环：规约栅栏 + 持续改进飞轮\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-143\"><span id=\"article-anchor-144\">三步打法之上，还有一个让系统越用越强的机制：</span></p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-145\"><span>•规约栅栏（持续优化）。 AI 犯错后，正确的动作不是简单地对话纠正，而是沉淀出一条规约去约束它不再犯同样的错。否则人类介入次数会陷入恶性循环。每一次纠错，都固化为组织的护栏。</span></div>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-146\"><span>•持续改进飞轮。 每次业务交付完成后，产出的方案、代码、测试记录、协作经验沉淀为业务知识，反哺 Agent 能力，构成\"交付 → 沉淀 → 增强 → 再交付\"的持续改进飞轮。</span></div>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-147\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-148\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-01a4ElInsi7GR8g24i.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-149\">\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"section-四-实践成效-从数据与案例看-ai-组织转型的真实收益\"><span id=\"article-anchor-151\">四、实践成效：从数据与案例看 AI 组织转型的真实收益</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-四-实践成效-从数据与案例看-ai-组织转型的真实收益\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：四、实践成效：从数据与案例看 AI 组织转型的真实收益\">#</a></h2>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-152\"><span id=\"article-anchor-153\">前三章讲的是\"为什么这么做\"和\"怎么做\"，这一章用<span id=\"article-anchor-154\"><span><span>真实案例与实测数据<span id=\"article-anchor-155\">来验证：站上组织视角、用 AI 重构流程/角色/结构之后，交付到底发生了什么变化。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-156\"><span id=\"article-anchor-157\">这套打法在物流国际技术部Multi AI Native平台上已经跑出了规模化的实践证据：<span id=\"article-anchor-158\"><span><span>64 个接入工作区、931 个在线 Agent、120 个研发小队、5945 个累计 Issue、1258 个已交付 Issue<span id=\"article-anchor-159\">（数据持续更新中）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"section-4-1-典型案例\"><span id=\"article-anchor-161\">4.1 典型案例</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-4-1-典型案例\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：4.1 典型案例\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-162\"><span id=\"article-anchor-163\">一个<span id=\"article-anchor-164\"><span><span>端到端的真实交付案例<span id=\"article-anchor-165\">，具象化\"AI 组织转型\"的完整链路——从需求进入、小队拆解、多 Agent 协同，到交付闭环，展示组织视角打法在一个具体项目上是如何跑通的。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-166\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-167\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-022QVwH8mR2s87BWM.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 id=\"section-4-2-使用情况分析\"><span id=\"article-anchor-169\">4.2 使用情况分析</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-4-2-使用情况分析\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：4.2 使用情况分析\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-170\"><span id=\"article-anchor-171\"><span><span>平台「全平台看板」的实测规模与质量数据<span id=\"article-anchor-172\">，直观佐证\"AI 深度参与后交付的规模化程度\"。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-173\"><span>•团队负责人先成为AI超级个体，带动团队转型AI Native</span></div>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-174\"><span>•AI Native先锋团队复制推广，加速组织的AI进化</span></div>\n<h4 id=\"article-anchor-175\"><span id=\"article-anchor-176\"><span><span>整体平台使用趋势</span></span></span></h4>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-177\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-178\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-03qPwChYdWgV8HmS3.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 id=\"article-anchor-179\"><span id=\"article-anchor-180\"><span><span>敏捷迭代AI全栈交付占比</span></span></span></h4>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-181\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-182\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-03dABMaKiNLKJrfzU.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 id=\"article-anchor-183\"><span id=\"article-anchor-184\"><span><span>效能</span></span></span></h4>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-185\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-186\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-04imlTSRtotKXiTQK.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 id=\"article-anchor-187\"><span id=\"article-anchor-188\"><span><span>质量</span></span></span></h4>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-189\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-190\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-04EYGUw8dJvgP9TRp.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 id=\"article-anchor-191\"><span id=\"article-anchor-192\"><span><span>用户反馈</span></span></span></h4>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-193\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-194\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-04nWhbNJna4J8ykLb.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 id=\"section-4-3-ai-native-前后对比表\"><span id=\"article-anchor-196\">4.3 AI Native 前后对比表</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-4-3-ai-native-前后对比表\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：4.3 AI Native 前后对比表\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-197\"><span id=\"article-anchor-198\">AI Native进化带来的不只是\"更快\"，而是流程、角色、协作、组织与沉淀方式的结构性重构。下图为组织转型带来的做法对照。</span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-199\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-200\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-04fyNg88h0U0Aja0m.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"section-五-定制化功能\"><span id=\"article-anchor-202\"><span><span>五、定制化功能</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-五-定制化功能\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：五、定制化功能\">#</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"section-5-1-coding-agent集群容器化部署-脱离个人机器-让ai-24小时运转\"><span id=\"article-anchor-204\"><span><span>5.1 Coding Agent集群容器化部署, 脱离个人机器, 让AI 24小时运转</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-5-1-coding-agent集群容器化部署-脱离个人机器-让ai-24小时运转\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：5.1 Coding Agent集群容器化部署, 脱离个人机器, 让AI 24小时运转\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-205\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-206\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-058deTWgptl7zKkBJ.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 id=\"section-5-2-京me机器人集成\"><span id=\"article-anchor-208\"><span><span>5.2 京Me机器人集成</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-5-2-京me机器人集成\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：5.2 京Me机器人集成\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-209\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-210\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-05WiDh5lcExWiMA8n.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 id=\"section-5-3-行云自动扫描\"><span id=\"article-anchor-212\"><span><span>5.3 行云自动扫描</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-5-3-行云自动扫描\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：5.3 行云自动扫描\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-213\"><span id=\"article-anchor-214\">自动扫描指定行云空间创建Issue</span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-215\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-216\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-05nPtwv8DaYEvGT566.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 id=\"section-5-4-规约中心\"><span id=\"article-anchor-218\"><span><span>5.4 规约中心</span></span></span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-5-4-规约中心\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：5.4 规约中心\">#</a></h3>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-219\"><span id=\"article-anchor-220\">工作区内运行时可授权采集记忆，平台分析生成规约专家复审可以作用于工作区及不同角色，复利至团队所有成员。</span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-221\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-222\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/shendengbucket1/2026-08-24-20-06K8DnwBQFdNpmt24X.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：文章图片\"></div>\n\n<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"article-anchor-223\">\n<div><hr></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"section-结语\"><span id=\"article-anchor-225\">结语</span><a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#section-结语\" aria-label=\"链接到本节：结语\">#</a></h2>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-226\"><span id=\"article-anchor-227\">AI 写代码，只是这场变革的起点，而不是终点。</span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-228\"><span id=\"article-anchor-229\">真正决定一个组织能否吃到 AI 红利的，不是\"能不能用 AI 写出代码\"，而是<span id=\"article-anchor-230\"><span><span>敢不敢用 AI 重新设计交付流程、重新划分角色分工、重新组织团队结构<span id=\"article-anchor-231\">。研发视角能把工具和个人推到极致，却会在组织的边界前止步；只有站上组织视角，把 <span id=\"article-anchor-232\"><span><code><span>AI × 工具</span></code><span id=\"article-anchor-233\"> 一路推进到 <span id=\"article-anchor-234\"><span><code><span>AI × 组织</span></code><span id=\"article-anchor-235\">，那些被 AI 照出来的摩擦，才会真正被抹平。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-236\"><span id=\"article-anchor-237\">国际技术部 Multi AI Native 想做的，正是这件事——<span id=\"article-anchor-238\"><span><span>让 Agent 成为你可靠的数字战友，让每一次迭代交付都快一个量级；更让整个组织，为 AI 而重新生长。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p id=\"article-anchor-239\"><span id=\"article-anchor-240\">你的下一批员工，不是人类。</span></p>\n\n",
